                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'p': '"**Hire purchase**" is a financial arrangement in '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'which a person **acquires immediate use of an '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'asset** by making **regular instalment payments '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'over a specified period**, and **may gain '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'ownership** of the asset on the completion of the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'payments.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'h4': '1(a)(ii)  Definition of finance lease — section '
                                                                                                                                                                                                           '201 of NTA',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'p': '"**Finance lease**" is a lease arrangement where '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'the **lessee effectively assumes most of the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'risks and rewards** associated with asset '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'ownership.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'key': 'The difference the question asks you to draw is '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'about **title**, not about risk. Both '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'arrangements give the user immediate use and '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'both put the **risks and rewards** on the user '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            '— which is why both are treated the same way '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'for capital allowances. The distinction is that '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'hire purchase **may transfer legal ownership on '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'completion of the payments**, whereas a finance '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'lease ordinarily does not: the lessee gets the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'economics of ownership without ever getting the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'title.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
