                                                                                                                                                                                                             'relieved, just through two different routes. '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'And because the **hirer/lessee is the deemed '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'owner**, the financier claims nothing — an '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'important point when negotiating, since the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'financier cannot pass on an allowance it never '
